text:
The following vessels are exempt from the duty to insure (specifically the obligation to remove or clear a wreck):

*   Warships (Kapal perang) [PP 31/2021, Pasal 150 ayat 3, p. 100];
*   State vessels used for government duties (Kapal Negara yang digunakan untuk melakukan tugas pemerintahan) [PP 31/2021, Pasal 150 ayat 3, p. 100];
*   Sail vessels and sail-motor vessels (Kapal layar dan Kapal layar motor) [PP 31/2021, Pasal 150 ayat 3, p. 100];
*   Motor vessels with a gross tonnage of less than 35 GT (Kapal motor dengan tonase kotor kurang dari GT 35) [PP 31/2021, Pasal 150 ayat 3, p. 100].

